# Names-only allowlist for the notifications and outbox workers (ADR-047 least privilege).
# Same resolution as docker-compose.runtime-app.allowlist. Workers also receive no
# revocation-state credentials and no email OTP keys (they do not own auth state),
# matching the launcher-redacted .env.docker.workers used by the full stack.
